          },
          "1612493877c1499503-2": {
            "type": "testimonial",
            "settings": {
              "text": "<p>Just did the online furniture painting class that <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/SerendipityHouseLLC/?__cft__[0]=AZXzdqPAZBuBeMZArHgQ3op09k_AS0-I0c-mx7yj0YGJieRa-V7PoFPrVvcWy6Su9dGQ1eY3ZJ7RVVN6rMfmKh8AaQK5LWa4Lz_ZdnQsVHPV-y9V-dd636q_U22xbStDGD2RsHnu0dGLkn2e_J_hfchpUhK1TZISLjFva4iaoQF6aA&amp;__tn__=kK-R\">Serendipity House LLC</a> offered. Great class from furniture repair, to different paints and finishes, to different techniques. Thank you Michelle for all the tips and assistance, can&#x27;t wait for the next class!</p>",
              "author": "Linda B"
            }
          }
