      "befdbabd-24bf-4292-8244-6e29dffa18b3": {
        "type": "featured-row",
        "settings": {
          "section_padding": true,
          "image": "shopify://shop_images/IMG_0422.jpg",
          "layout": "left",
          "text_align": "left",
          "title": "Meet Michelle of Serendipity House",
          "text": "<p>Michelle is a lifelong collector of beautiful things & crafting, although she never dreamt this passion would serendipitously become her livelihood.  In 2013, following a career in Children's Therapy, Michelle’s love for creating, painting, treasure hunting & antique craftsmanship lead Serendipity House to be born. She has a passion for people & their stories, especially for helping them take a leap of faith with a paintbrush & big ideas.<br/><br/>Michelle favors furniture painting, as it’s become her place to be lost & found all at once. Years of faux finishes &  interior decorating for herself & others were the catalyst for furniture painting. Sooner or later, one runs out of house, but furniture is plentiful!<br/><br/>In July 2023, Serendipity House moved into their newly built shop at 22 Glebe Road/Route 9 in Spofford New Hampshire; a destination for curated furniture, curiosities, artwork, home decor, gifts & boutique DIY. </p>",
          "button_label": "",
          "button_link": ""
        }
      },
